out.push(A('**One student reads the sentence that holds both positions twice, once with the stress on the shared half and once on the differing half.** ⚠ **The room says what each version is about.** **The first is heard as an argument with the shared half, which nobody is having.** **Close on Dr Qabbani\'s sentence: I wrote the paper to make the figures unarguable and it worked.**'));
