out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('**One student reads a shared conclusion twice, once with the stress on _both_ and once on each of the two reasons.** ⚠ **The room says, after each reading, how many repairs it heard.** **After the first version the answer is one, every time** — **which is the finding of the cycle in eight seconds and needs no commentary.** **Close on Mrs Rizk\'s sentence: my minute recorded what the two reviewers had in common.**'));
