out.push(A('**One student reads their first sentence twice, timing the two halves.** ⚠ **The room says which half took longer.** **It is the writer\'s own position in about three readings out of four**, and the timing finds it where the counting of words did not, because a held position is also read more slowly. **Close on Mr Shihabi\'s sentence: the desk was right, and the first paragraph was a position.**'));
