out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards name nothing to compare with** — ⚠ _the best available anywhere_ **and** _better than it looks_ **are both unplaceable** — **and the honest answer is that no recommendation can be made from them.** **Rows 3 are the useful ones**: sixty pages and four hundred pages are each a cost to somebody, and the room should say to whom. **Expect the class to try to rescue rows 2 and 4 by inventing alternatives; refuse it.**'));
